1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:07,139
With Dotrino Terminal you get into your computer from any device: your phone, a tablet or another computer.

2
00:00:07,089 --> 00:00:13,589
First, on the computer you want to get into, install the Terminal agent with a single command.

3
00:00:13,589 --> 00:00:16,892
The first time, it asks you to link it to your Vault.

4
00:00:16,892 --> 00:00:23,668
In your Vault, ask for an invitation, paste it into the agent and approve the code it shows you.

5
00:00:23,668 --> 00:00:25,615
You only do this once.

6
00:00:25,615 --> 00:00:33,247
Then link the device you'll use to get in: scan the invitation from your Vault and approve there the code that appears on the screen.

7
00:00:33,247 --> 00:00:34,260
That's it.

8
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:36,405
Open Terminal on that device.

9
00:00:36,405 --> 00:00:39,431
Your computers show up in the list by themselves.

10
00:00:39,431 --> 00:00:41,076
Pick one and you're in.

11
00:00:41,076 --> 00:00:45,721
What you type travels end-to-end encrypted, only between your devices.

12
00:00:45,721 --> 00:00:51,576
If you close the app, the console stays open on your computer, and you pick up where you left off.

13
00:00:51,576 --> 00:00:53,207
Dotrino Terminal.

14
00:00:53,207 --> 00:00:55,536
Your computer, from anywhere.

